  "row_guide": "Band0 (y0\u2013768): concrete perimeter walls (plain/barbed/arrow corners/modular pillars+panels), standalone razor wire, warning signs, spotlights, railing enclosure, bunker entrance building, spotlight platform, watchtower top, silo/tower base, boom barriers. Band1 (y768\u20131536): Quonset hangars (small/tall closed/open/interior cutaway), narrow red-door tower, L-shaped + rectangular barracks + wall/roof modules, boom gates, streetlights, numbered lockers, utility box, stairs/walkway, wood fence, antenna mast bases. Band2 (y1536\u20132304): dormitory N-05, grey bunkers, wall+HVAC strip, tan/grey tents closed+open, sandbag ring/stacks, tires, training dummies/targets, helmet, bunks/beds, lockers/shelves/footlockers/chairs, medical crates/kits/supplies, antennas, pipes, whiteboard/map boards, desks. Band3 (y2304\u20133072): radio/radar towers (column, lattice frame, lattice+dome, base), green tank assembled E/W/S/N + hulls + turrets. Band4 (y3072\u20133840): green chassis/turret modular extras; tan/brown tanks assembled E/W/S/N + hulls + multi-row turrets + side chassis. Band5 (y3840\u20134575): helicopter side/top/bottom complete+body, detached main/tail rotors, mines."
